{"id":"d0dd6e13d9340c41","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Dedekind Complete Order","display":"df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order — ZFC Order9 Dedekind Complete Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order — ZFC Order9 Dedekind Complete Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order — ZFC Order9 Dedekind Complete Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R\\in V\">\\(L,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DedekindCompleteOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DedekindCompleteOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}complete\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DedekindCompleteOrder}_S(L,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(L,R)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\left(\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\exists u\\in L\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\n\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.{}\\to\\exists s\\in L\\;\\left(\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,s\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\forall v\\in L\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,v\\rangle\\in R)\n\\to\\langle s,v\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}complete\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DedekindCompleteOrder}_S(L,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(L,R)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\left(\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\exists u\\in L\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\n\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.{}\\to\\exists s\\in L\\;\\left(\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,s\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\forall v\\in L\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,v\\rangle\\in R)\n\\to\\langle s,v\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary order-theoretic definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DedekindCompleteOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}complete\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DedekindCompleteOrder}_S(L,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Poset}(L,R)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\left(\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\exists u\\in L\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\n\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R\\right.\\\\\n&\\qquad\\left.{}\\to\\exists s\\in L\\;\\left(\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,s\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\forall v\\in L\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,v\\rangle\\in R)\n\\to\\langle s,v\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1259,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2970","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order.md|58-df-zfc-order9-dedekind-complete-order]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}